join Lindi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Lindi (Warm)
Lindi: Biggest haul I've ever been part of. Genuinely — I've been counting since I was fifteen and this is the biggest.
- But?
	Hope: But?
	Lindi: But I walked past about the same amount again and left it standing.
	Lindi: That's normal. That's every year. I'm only saying it because you asked.
